e user with an empty text prompt. Furthermore, manual text entry often returns `0 Nodes Illuminated` because backend regex linkers fail to extract entity primary keys from natural language titles.\n2. **The Desired Functional Behavior:**\n   Clicking \"INQUIRE IN GRAPHRAG CHAT\" becomes an active, one-click intelligence trigger that:\n   - Automatically opens [`AgentChatDrawer.tsx`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T172426-897-pj8g/src/frontend/src/components/AgentChatDrawer.tsx) if closed.\n   - Deterministically constructs an entity-specific prompt referencing the selected node's label, title, and bracketed `[primary_key]` across all 14 entity types.\n   - Appends the inquiry message to the conversational history as a distinct turn without clearing prior messages.\n   - Disables the button and shows `◈ INQUIRING...` to prevent rapid concurrent submissions.\n   - Dispatches `POST /api/graphrag/query` with an explicit `primary_key` parameter.\n   - Bypasses backend regex parsing to anchor directly to the verified Neo4j entity node.\n   - Traverses the connected neighborhood in Neo4j, reconstructing authentic edge keys (`${src}-\u003e${rel}-\u003e${tgt}`) with complete provenance.\n   - Synthesizes grounded LLM guidance quoting the bracketed primary key and renders the response telemetry badge.\n   - Triggers real-time canvas illumination and smooth camera zoom framing of the active subgraph.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Stage 3 \u0026 4: Architectural Decision Register \u0026 Wayfinder DAG\n\nAll architectural decisions have been deconstructed into monotonically increasing decision tickets within `wayfinder/20261013T172426-897-pj8g/tickets/` and indexed in [`wayfinder/20261013T172426-897-pj8g/map.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T172426-897-pj8g/wayfinder/20261013T172426-897-pj8g/map.md):\n\n| Ticket | Human-Readable Ticket Name | Scope / Tier | Status | Blocked By |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 